nication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:11;a:5:{s:5:\"quote\";s:217:\"Raihan made the entire property-buying process smooth and stress-free. He understood exactly what I was looking for and guided me through every step. His communication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:12;a:5:{s:5:\"quote\";s:217:\"Raihan made the entire property-buying process smooth and stress-free. He understood exactly what I was looking for and guided me through every step. His communication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:13;a:5:{s:5:\"quote\";s:217:\"Raihan made the entire property-buying process smooth and stress-free. He understood exactly what I was looking for and guided me through every step. His communication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:14;a:5:{s:5:\"quote\";s:217:\"Raihan made the entire property-buying process smooth and stress-free. He understood exactly what I was looking for and guided me through every step. His communication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:15;a:5:{s:5:\"quote\";s:217:\"Raihan made the entire property-buying process smooth and stress-free. He understood exactly what I was looking for and guided me through every step. His communication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:16;a:5:{s:5:\"quote\";s:217:\"Raihan made the entire property-buying process smooth and stress-free. He understood exactly what I was looking for and guided me through every step. His communication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:17;a:5:{s:5:\"quote\";s:217:\"Raihan made the entire property-buying process smooth and stress-free. He understood exactly what I was looking for and guided me through every step. His communication and professional approach made a real difference.\";s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Client Name\";s:4:\"role\";s:28:\"Property Buyer · Dubai, UAE\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}i:18;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}}','auto');
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_options` VALUES (401,'rr_about_page','a:21:{s:7:\"eyebrow\";s:8:\"About me\";s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Raihan <em>Shaikh</em>\";s:8:\"hero_img\";s:20:\"gen-office-dusk.webp\";s:3:\"tag\";s:8:\"About Me\";s:2:\"h2\";s:51:\"Raihan Shaikh<br><em>Property Consultant Dubai</em>\";s:5:\"photo\";s:81:\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-9.png\";s:2:\"p1\";s:330:\"I am Raihan Shaikh, a senior property consultant in Dubai with Homes 4 Life Real Estate. Five years in this market has taught me one thing: the deal is easy, the decision is hard. So I work the decision first. What the service charge actually costs, what the rental cheques really look like, what resale looks like four years out.\";s:2:\"p2\";s:296:\"Most of my clients start in Business Bay, Downtown or Dubai Marina and end up somewhere they did not expect: JVC, Arjan, a villa in Damac Hills. That is fine. My job is not to sell you a building. It is to make sure the one you pick still makes sense to you in 2030, not just on the day you sign.\";s:5:\"quote\";s:75:\"If a deal is not right for you, I will say so. There is always another one.\";s:3:\"btn\";s:13:\"More about us\";s:7:\"why_tag\";s:13:\"Why choose us\";s:6:\"why_h2\";s:51:\"What you get that a portal<br>page cannot give you.\";s:9:\"why_photo\";s:23:\"villa-pool-terrace.webp\";s:7:\"badge_b\";s:8:\"5+ years\";s:7:\"badge_s\";s:54:\"in the Dubai market, from Business Bay to Damac Hills.\";s:8:\"features\";a:5:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:\"icon\";s:6:\"shield\";s:5:\"title\";s:24:\"Trusted property experts\";s:4:\"text\";s:159:\"Five years, one market, real transactions. Every number I quote can be checked against the DLD register. I would rather you verify me than take my word for it.\";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:\"icon\";s:8:\"building\";s:5:\"title\";s:24:\"Access before the portal\";s:4:\"text\";s:159:\"Off-plan launches, resale units and negotiated prices often move before an advert goes live. You hear about them from me first, with the payment plan attached.\";}i:2;a:3:{s:4:\"icon\";s:7:\"process\";s:5:\"title\";s:27:\"A process with no surprises\";s:4:\"text\";s:156:\"Reservation, DLD fees, NOC, trustee transfer, snagging. You get the full checklist up front with the costs written next to each line, not after the deposit.\";}i:3;a:3:{s:4:\"icon\";s:5:\"phone\";s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"One number that answers\";s:4:\"text\";s:156:\"No call centre, no rotating agents. You deal with me from the first WhatsApp to the handover, and after it, when the tenant or the resale question comes up.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";}}s:9:\"close_tag\";s:10:\"Let\'s talk\";s:8:\"close_h2\";s:62:\"Tell me what you\'re after and I\'ll tell you <em>honestly.</em>\";s:7:\"close_p\";s:82:\"One call, no pitch. Bring your budget and your timeline. I will bring the numbers.\";s:9:\"close_btn\";s:24:\"Book a free consultation\";s:8:\"close_wa\";s:11:\"WhatsApp me\";}','auto');
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_options` VALUES (404,'rr_contact_page','a:20:{s:12:\"banner_title\";s:7:\"Contact\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:20:\"gen-office-dusk.webp\";s:7:\"eyebrow\";s:12:\"Get In Touch\";s:5:\"title\";s:37:\"Let\'s Find the Right Property for You\";s:4:\"lede\";s:154:\"Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.\";s:5:\"phone\";s:16:\"+971 52 102 7252\";s:8:\"call_lbl\";s:7:\"Call me\";s:8:\"whatsapp\";s:12:\"971521027252\";s:6:\"wa_lbl\";s:8:\"WhatsApp\";s:6:\"wa_sub\";s:10:\"Message me\";s:5:\"email\";s:23:\"hello@realtorraihan.com\";s:9:\"email_lbl\";s:5:\"Email\";s:4:\"area\";s:24:\"Business Bay, Dubai, UAE\";s:8:\"area_lbl\";s:8:\"Based in\";s:6:\"form_h\";s:15:\"Send an enquiry\";s:6:\"form_p\";s:61:\"Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.\";s:8:\"btn_text\";s:12:\"Send Enquiry\";s:9:\"fine_text\";s:68:\"Your details stay between us, I never share them without permission.\";s:6:\"done_h\";s:37:\"Thank you, your enquiry is on its way\";s:6:\"done_p\";s:108:\"I will reply personally, usually the same day. If you would rather talk now, call or message me on WhatsApp.\";}','auto');
