INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (2,1,'2026-11-19 04:57:32','2026-11-19 04:57:32','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is an example page. It\'s different from a blog post because it will stay in one place and will show up in your site navigation (in most themes). Most people start with an About page that introduces them to potential site visitors. It might say something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hi there! I\'m a bike messenger by day, aspiring actor by night, and this is my website. I live in Los Angeles, have a great dog named Jack, and I like pi&#241;a coladas. (And gettin\' caught in the rain.)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>...or something like this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The XYZ Doohickey Company was founded in 1971, and has been providing quality doohickeys to the public ever since. Located in Gotham City, XYZ employs over 2,000 people and does all kinds of awesome things for the Gotham community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a new WordPress user, you should go to <a href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-admin/\">your dashboard</a> to delete this page and create new pages for your content. Have fun!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Sample Page','','publish','closed','open','','sample-page','','','2026-11-19 04:57:32','2026-11-19 04:57:32','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?page_id=2',0,'page','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (3,1,'2026-11-19 04:57:32','2026-11-19 04:57:32','<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n','Privacy Policy','','draft','closed','open','','privacy-policy','','','2026-11-19 04:57:32','2026-11-19 04:57:32','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?page_id=3',0,'page','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (5,0,'2026-11-19 04:59:49','2026-11-19 04:59:49','<!-- wp:page-list /-->','Navigation','','publish','closed','closed','','navigation','','','2026-11-19 04:59:49','2026-11-19 04:59:49','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/navigation/',0,'wp_navigation','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (7,1,'2026-11-19 05:29:02','2026-11-19 05:29:02','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or About page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Page banner</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Raihan Shaikh</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>About section</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Raihan ShaikhProperty Consultant Dubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-9.png</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I am Raihan Shaikh, a senior property consultant in Dubai with Homes 4 Life Real Estate. Five years in this market has taught me one thing: the deal is easy, the decision is hard. So I work the decision first. What the service charge actually costs, what the rental cheques really look like, what resale looks like four years out.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Most of my clients start in Business Bay, Downtown or Dubai Marina and end up somewhere they did not expect: JVC, Arjan, a villa in Damac Hills. That is fine. My job is not to sell you a building. It is to make sure the one you pick still makes sense to you in 2030, not just on the day you sign.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If a deal is not right for you, I will say so. There is always another one.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>More about us</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose us</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why choose us</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>What you get that a portalpage cannot give you.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>villa-pool-terrace.webp</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Badge on the photo</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+ years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>in the Dubai market, from Business Bay to Damac Hills.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Closing call to action</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Let\'s talk</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Tell me what you\'re after and I\'ll tell you honestly.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One call, no pitch. Bring your budget and your timeline. I will bring the numbers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book a free consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>WhatsApp me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four points on the About page</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Trusted property experts | Five years, one market, real transactions. Every number I quote can be checked against the DLD register. I would rather you verify me than take my word for it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Access before the portal | Off-plan launches, resale units and negotiated prices often move before an advert goes live. You hear about them from me first, with the payment plan attached.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A process with no surprises | Reservation, DLD fees, NOC, trustee transfer, snagging. You get the full checklist up front with the costs written next to each line, not after the deposit.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One number that answers | No call centre, no rotating agents. You deal with me from the first WhatsApp to the handover, and after it, when the tenant or the resale question comes up.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','About','','publish','closed','closed','','about','','','2026-11-20 11:46:53','2026-11-20 11:46:53','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/about/',0,'page','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (8,1,'2026-11-19 05:29:02','2026-11-19 05:29:02','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Blog page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Hero Banner</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property notes</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Dubai property,\r\nexplained properly.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Service charges, yields, payment plans, handover snags and the paperwork nobody warns you about. These are the notes I would send a friend before they buy. Short, specific, and written from deals I have actually closed.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>skyline-dusk-wide.webp</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Articles List &amp; Filter</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Blog</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Discover our latest Dubai\r\nproperty insights.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>All</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Read the note</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>No articles yet. Add your first one under Posts.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Newsletter Band</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>One note a month,\r\nno noise.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A short email with what actually moved in the Dubai market, plus one thing worth knowing before your next viewing. Unsubscribe any time.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>you@example.com</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Subscribe</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One email a month. Unsubscribe any time.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Blog','','publish','closed','closed','','blog','','','2026-11-19 12:37:36','2026-11-19 12:37:36','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/blog/',0,'page','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (9,1,'2026-11-19 05:29:02','2026-11-19 05:29:02','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Home Page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Hero (top of the page)</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant · Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh,</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your next property move deserves <b> the right advice..</b></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I\'m a professional property consultant in Dubai who helps people buy, sell, rent and invest with confidence. You get straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book A Free Consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Introduction and stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Introduction</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Turning Your Dubai Property\r\nGoals into Smart Real Estate\r\nInvestments</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Working with a Dubai real estate agent should feel clear and honest. Buy, sell, or rent with personal guidance from the first call to handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai moves fast. If you\'re buying here for the first time, the choices can feel endless. Prices change from one community to the next, paperwork has its own rules, and not every listing is as good as the photos suggest.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>That\'s where I come in. As a real estate agent in Dubai, I work with investors, families, and business owners to find properties that fit their budget and their goals. Then I stay with them through negotiation, financing, and handover. Tell me what you\'re after, and I\'ll tell you honestly what makes sense.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>YEARS IN DUBAI PROPERTY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Founder &amp; Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Years of Experience</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hands-on knowledge ofthe Dubai market</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>100+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Satisfied Clients</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers, sellers, landlords,and investors</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>10</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Locations Covered</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Popular communitiesacross Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>24/7</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Continuous Support &amp; Guidance</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Help before, during,and after the deal</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why invest in Dubai</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Invest</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Investors Choose \r\nDubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>People from all over the world invest in Dubai property for practical reasons. Here are the ones I explain to my clients most often.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>13</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>reasons clients ask about, in plain English</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Services</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What I Offer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Dubai Property Advisory</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Whether you want to buy, sell, rent, or invest in commercial real estate, I offer property consulting services in Dubai built around your situation. Here\'s how I can help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Client testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Client Success Stories</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Building trust through honest advice, personalized service, and successful property journeys in Dubai.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Names and identities are withheld until written consent is on file.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose me</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Choose Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Choose Me?</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Questions?\r\nI am Here To Help.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The things buyers, sellers and investors ask me most often about Dubai property, answered straight, with no sales gloss.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask Me Directly</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Contact</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Get In Touch</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Let\'s Find the Right Property for You</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send an enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Service cards</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sell Property | Thinking of selling your property in Dubai? I&#039;ll help you set a realistic price, present the home well, and reach serious buyers. I handle viewings, negotiate offers, and guide the paperwork through to closing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buy Property | I start with your budget, goals and timeline, then shortlist homes and investments that fit, share honest market insight and negotiate for you.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rent Property | I match tenants with suitable places and landlords with reliable tenants, and help with rental pricing, lease terms and the practical details.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Commercial | Offices, retail and industrial units need a different approach. I help owners and investors find space that fits, then negotiate protective terms.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mortgage Guidance | Dubai mortgages have their own rules for expats and non-residents. I explain your options, connect you with lenders and help you compare offers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Golden Visa Guidance | I explain how property investment can support a Golden Visa application and check the property meets current requirements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Business Setup | I explain the general process, point you to trusted setup partners and help you find the right office or commercial space.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bank Account Support | Opening a bank account is often the first hurdle for new investors in Dubai. I guide you through what banks usually ask for and introduce you to the right contacts, so your payments and transfers run smoothly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ questions and answers</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying off-plan in Dubai? | Costs can vary by project and by developer. As a general guide, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD registration fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price, usually paid via Oqood registration. This is generally the main government registration fee, not an additional fee on top of Oqood.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Oqood and admin fees:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 4,020 for DLD admin, plus small knowledge and innovation fees. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer admin fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and project. Some developers may waive it as part of a launch offer. Ask for it in writing before booking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your instalments after booking are generally paid according to the payment plan in your Sales and Purchase Agreement (SPA). Always check your own SPA.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying a ready or secondary property in Dubai? | For a completed resale property, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD transfer fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Trustee office fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Often AED 2,000 plus VAT for properties below AED 500,000, and AED 4,000 plus VAT for properties at AED 500,000 and above. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Title deed issuance:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 580.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Agency commission:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around 2% of the price plus 5% VAT on a secondary purchase. The exact commission should be agreed in writing before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer NOC fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and community. Your agent can help you confirm the current amount before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Mortgage costs, if financed:&lt;/strong&gt; Mortgage registration is generally 0.25% of the loan amount plus AED 290 admin, plus bank valuation and processing fees, subject to the bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a general guide only, many cash buyers budget around 7% to 8% on top of the price for a resale purchase. Your actual total will depend on your property, your financing and your contract.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How are off-plan payments generally handled? Are they protected? | Under Dubai Law No. 8 of 2007, registered off-plan projects are generally required to have a dedicated escrow account with an approved UAE bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your payments are generally required to go into that project escrow account, not into an agent personal account or a general developer account. The account is generally named in your SPA. Before you pay, verify the escrow account details in your SPA and on the DLD project record, and always keep your payment receipts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Escrow is designed to reduce risk. It does not remove all investment risk. Always check the developer track record and project status, and consider independent advice.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Is it possible to get a UAE visa or Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai? | It may be possible, subject to approval and current authority requirements. A purchase does not automatically give you a visa.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10-Year Golden Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; You may be eligible if you own property worth AED 2 million or more. This may be one property or a portfolio in your name. Mortgaged property may qualify with a bank letter or NOC confirming at least AED 2 million has been paid, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-Year Property Investor Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; If you are the sole owner of a completed property, there may currently be no minimum property value requirement. If the property is jointly owned, each investor may need to hold a share worth at least AED 400,000 to qualify, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Visas are not guaranteed with purchase. You must still meet medical, insurance, documentation and authority approval requirements. Confirm your eligibility before booking if a visa is a main reason for buying.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How can I generally verify a developer and project before I pay? | Before booking, consider checking:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Whether the project is registered with DLD and has an active escrow account.&lt;br&gt;• Whether the developer name, project name and escrow account in your SPA match the DLD record.&lt;br&gt;• The developer track record for delivery, quality and handover.&lt;br&gt;• The payment plan, handover date, grace period and resale or NOC terms in the SPA.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A genuine agent should be willing to share the SPA, project registration details and escrow information before asking for payment. Do not rely only on marketing material.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-11-23 10:52:04','2026-11-23 10:52:04','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/home/',0,'page','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (10,1,'2026-11-19 05:29:02','2026-11-19 05:29:02','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Contact page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Heading &amp; Introduction</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Get In Touch</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Let\'s Find the Right Property for You</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Direct Channels &amp; Office Details</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>+971 52 102 7252</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Call me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>971521027252</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>WhatsApp</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Message me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>hello@realtorraihan.com</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Email</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Business Bay, Dubai, UAE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Based in</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Enquiry Form &amp; Confirmation</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send an enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send Enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your details stay between us, I never share them without permission.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Thank you, your enquiry is on its way</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I will reply personally, usually the same day. If you would rather talk now, call or message me on WhatsApp.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Contact','','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2026-11-23 05:28:53','2026-11-23 05:28:53','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/',0,'page','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (11,1,'2026-11-19 05:29:13','2026-11-19 05:29:13','{\"version\": 3, \"isGlobalStylesUserThemeJSON\": true }','Custom Styles','','publish','closed','closed','','wp-global-styles-realtor-raihan','','','2026-11-19 05:29:13','2026-11-19 05:29:13','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-global-styles-realtor-raihan/',0,'wp_global_styles','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (26,0,'2026-01-30 09:00:00','2026-01-30 09:00:00','<p class=\"po-lede\">Property is one of the routes to a UAE Golden Visa, and it is the one most buyers ask about. The headline is simple; the conditions are where people get stuck. This is general guidance, not legal advice.</p>\n<h2>The headline</h2>\n<p>A property investment at or above the current threshold can support a renewable residency. The threshold and the qualifying conditions are set by the authorities and do change, so confirm the number in force on the day you buy, with the authority or a licensed professional.</p>\n<h2>Ownership conditions that trip people up</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Off-plan usually does not count.</strong> The investment generally needs to be completed and registered, not a reservation on a future building.</li>\n<li><strong>Mortgaged property.</strong> Where a bank is involved, the qualifying value is usually the equity, not the headline price. Confirm before you structure.</li>\n<li><strong>Joint ownership.</strong> Shared title deeds may need each share to qualify, or a specific structure. Check before you split a purchase.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>Buy the property because it is a good property. Let the visa be a consequence, not the reason.</blockquote>\n<h2>The paperwork that stalls applications</h2>\n<p>Title deed in the right name, valuation where required, and a clean translation of any document not in Arabic or English. Most delays are administrative, not substantive.</p>\n<h2>What I do and do not do</h2>\n<p>I handle the property side: sourcing, negotiating, the DLD process and the handover. For immigration advice I will point you to a licensed professional. Anyone who promises you a visa outcome without that is guessing.</p>','Golden Visa through property: what qualifies','Property is one of the routes to a UAE Golden Visa, and it is the one most buyers ask about. The headline is simple; the conditions are where people get stuck.','publish','open','open','','golden-visa','','','2026-01-30 09:00:00','2026-01-30 09:00:00','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/golden-visa/',0,'post','',0);
