n.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Thank you, your enquiry is on its way</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I will reply personally, usually the same day. If you would rather talk now, call or message me on WhatsApp.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Contact','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 05:28:53','2026-11-23 05:28:53','',10,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=122',0,'revision','',0);
