 property consultant who supports buyers, sellers, landlords, and investors with clear advice and ongoing assistance, from the first consultation to the final handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What does a property consultant in Dubai do? | A property consultant helps you make informed decisions about buying, selling, renting, or investing. This includes market research, property shortlisting, price negotiation, paperwork guidance, and introductions to mortgage lenders. Raihan Shaikh helps clients navigate these decisions with practical advice and a focus on their property goals.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How can I buy property in Dubai as a foreigner? | Foreigners can buy freehold property in designated areas of Dubai. The usual steps include setting a budget, shortlisting properties, signing the sale agreement, paying a deposit, and completing the transfer at the Dubai Land Department. Working with a knowledgeable property consultant like Raihan Shaikh can help you understand the process and navigate each step.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What extra costs should I expect when buying property in Dubai? | Beyond the purchase price, expect the Dubai Land Department transfer fee, usually 4% of the price, plus agency fees, trustee office fees, and mortgage charges if you&#039;re financing. Fees vary by deal, so ask for a full cost breakdown before you sign anything.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What is the difference between a real estate agent, an agency, and a consultant in Dubai? | A real estate agent is a licensed individual who handles transactions. A real estate agency or company is the firm that employs agents. A property consultant focuses on advice, which means market analysis, strategy, and long-term planning, and often handles transactions too.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Can non-residents get a mortgage in Dubai? | Yes, many UAE banks lend to non-residents, though they often ask for a larger down payment than they do for residents. Rates and terms differ by bank and by your income profile, so comparing several offers is wise.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Can I get a Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai? | Qualifying property investors can apply for a long-term UAE residency, and the minimum property value has been AED 2 million. Requirements can change, so confirm the current rules with official sources or with your consultant before buying.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Is buying property in Dubai a good investment right now? | It can be, depending on the area, property type, and your goals. Dubai offers no personal income tax, a large rental market, and strong international demand. However, prices can rise and fall, so compare options carefully and consider your investment timeline. Raihan Shaikh can help buyers and investors assess suitable areas and property options based on their objectives.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Should I choose off-plan or ready property in Dubai? | Off-plan properties usually cost less upfront and offer staged payment plans, but you wait for completion and rely on the developer. Ready properties let you move in or start renting right away. The better choice depends on your budget, timeline, and risk comfort.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How do I contact Raihan Shaikh, and what happens in the first consultation? | Call +971 52 102 7252, email hello@realtorraihan.com, or use the form on this page. In the first conversation, we talk through your goals, budget, and timeline. Then I outline realistic options, and there&#039;s no pressure to commit.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 06:13:55','2026-11-23 06:13:55','',9,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=125',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (126,1,'2026-11-23 06:37:19','2026-11-23 06:37:19','<div class=\"invest-13-article\"><p class=\"invest-13-lede\">Discover the key reasons why Dubai continues to attract property buyers and investors from around the world. Explore the factors that shape the market and what to consider before making a property decision.</p><div class=\"invest-13-grid\"><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/sv-bg-skyline-1024x439.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">01</span><h2>Strategic Location</h2><p>Dubai sits where Europe, Asia, and Africa meet, and its airports connect to cities across the globe. That reach draws buyers, tenants, and businesses from everywhere, which keeps demand for homes and offices active.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-office-dusk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">02</span><h2>Stable Economy</h2><p>The city earns from trade, tourism, aviation, finance, and logistics, not from one industry alone. A mixed economy gives property owners a steadier base than markets that depend on a single sector.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/penthouse-living-sunset.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">03</span><h2>Tax-Free Environment</h2><p>The UAE has no personal income tax, so rental income and property gains are not taxed in your personal hands. Business activity can bring corporate tax or VAT into the picture, so I always suggest a quick word with a tax adviser.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-marina-night.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">04</span><h2>Thriving Rental Market</h2><p>Dubai has a large tenant population of professionals, families and newcomers. Rental yields are often higher than in many major global cities, though they vary by area and property type. I&#039;ll show you real figures for the Dubai property you&#039;re considering.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-2-marina-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">05</span><h2>Infrastructure Development</h2><p>Metro lines, new roads, airports, hospitals, and schools keep expanding. As connectivity across Dubai improves, the city becomes more attractive to live in and rent out.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-villa-evening.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">06</span><h2>World-Class Lifestyle</h2><p>Beaches, schools, healthcare, dining and entertainment are accessible across Dubai. That quality of life is what keeps tenants renewing and buyers arriving.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/villa-pool-terrace.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">07</span><h2>Freehold Ownership</h2><p>Foreign buyers can own freehold property outright in designated areas, with title registered at the Dubai Land Department. No local sponsor is needed for those homes.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/penthouse-terrace-dusk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">08</span><h2>Residency Through Property</h2><p>A qualifying property investment can support a renewable residency. The thresholds change, so we confirm the current rule before you commit.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/downtown-walk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">09</span><h2>Strong Developer Track Record</h2><p>Dubai&#039;s major developers deliver on schedule more often than not, and their escrow rules protect off-plan buyers. I only bring you developers I have seen hand over.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-4-sunset-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">10</span><h2>Currency Advantage</h2><p>The dirham is pegged to the US dollar, which removes one layer of exchange risk for many international buyers and makes rental income easier to plan.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-3-villa-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">11</span><h2>Transparent Regulation</h2><p>RERA licensing, escrow accounts and a public transaction register make Dubai one of the easier markets to verify. You can check almost everything I tell you.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-1-downtown-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">12</span><h2>Population Growth</h2><p>The city keeps adding residents, and each new arrival needs a home. Supply is catching up in some areas, which is exactly why property selection matters.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/marina-daylight.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">13</span><h2>Golden Visa Pathway</h2><p>Property is one of the routes to long-term residency, and it is the one most of my clients ask about first. We go through the conditions honestly.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article></div></div>','13 Reasons to Invest in Dubai','Discover the key reasons why Dubai continues to attract property buyers and investors from around the world.','publish','open','open','','13-reasons-to-invest-in-dubai','','','2026-11-23 09:53:13','2026-11-23 09:53:13','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/13-reasons-to-invest-in-dubai/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (127,0,'2026-11-23 06:38:06','2026-11-23 06:38:06','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Home Page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Hero (top of the page)</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant · Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh,</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your next property move deserves <b> the right advice..</b></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I\'m a professional property consultant in Dubai who helps people buy, sell, rent and invest with confidence. You get straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book A Free Consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Introduction and stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Introduction</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Turning Your Dubai Property\r\nGoals into Smart Real Estate\r\nInvestments</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Working with a Dubai real estate agent should feel clear and honest. Buy, sell, or rent with personal guidance from the first call to handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai moves fast. If you\'re buying here for the first time, the choices can feel endless. Prices change from one community to the next, paperwork has its own rules, and not every listing is as good as the photos suggest.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>That\'s where I come in. As a real estate agent in Dubai, I work with investors, families, and business owners to find properties that fit their budget and their goals. Then I stay with them through negotiation, financing, and handover. Tell me what you\'re after, and I\'ll tell you honestly what makes sense.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>YEARS IN DUBAI PROPERTY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Founder &amp; Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Years of Experience</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hands-on knowledge ofthe Dubai market</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>100+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Satisfied Clients</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers, sellers, landlords,and investors</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>10</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Locations Covered</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Popular communitiesacross Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>24/7</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Continuous Support &amp; Guidance</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Help before, during,and after the deal</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why invest in Dubai</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Invest</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Investors Choose \r\nDubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>People from all over the world invest in Dubai property for practical reasons. Here are the ones I explain to my clients most often.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>13</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>reasons clients ask about, in plain English</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Services</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What I Offer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Dubai Property Advisory</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Whether you want to buy, sell, rent, or invest in commercial real estate, I offer property consulting services in Dubai built around your situation. Here\'s how I can help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Client testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Client Success Stories</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Building trust through honest advice, personalized service, and successful property journeys in Dubai.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Names and identities are withheld until written consent is on file.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose me</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Choose Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Work  With Me</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Questions?\r\nI am Here To Help.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The things buyers, sellers and investors ask me most often about Dubai property, answered straight, with no sales gloss.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask Me Directly</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Contact</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Get In Touch</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Let\'s Find the Right Property for You</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send an enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Service cards</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sell Property | Thinking of selling your property in Dubai? I&#039;ll help you set a realistic price, present the home well, and reach serious buyers. I handle viewings, negotiate offers, and guide the paperwork through to closing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buy Property | I start with your budget, goals and timeline, then shortlist homes and investments that fit, share honest market insight and negotiate for you.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rent Property | I match tenants with suitable places and landlords with reliable tenants, and help with rental pricing, lease terms and the practical details.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Commercial | Offices, retail and industrial units need a different approach. I help owners and investors find space that fits, then negotiate protective terms.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mortgage Guidance | Dubai mortgages have their own rules for expats and non-residents. I explain your options, connect you with lenders and help you compare offers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Golden Visa Guidance | I explain how property investment can support a Golden Visa application and check the property meets current requirements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Business Setup | I explain the general process, point you to trusted setup partners and help you find the right office or commercial space.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bank Account Support | Opening a bank account is often the first hurdle for new investors in Dubai. I guide you through what banks usually ask for and introduce you to the right contacts, so your payments and transfers run smoothly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ questions and answers</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Who is the best property consultant in Dubai? | The best property consultant is Raihan Shaikh, who is licensed, understands the community you&#039;re targeting, and is transparent about costs. Raihan Shaikh is a Dubai-based property consultant who supports buyers, sellers, landlords, and investors with clear advice and ongoing assistance, from the first consultation to the final handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What does a property consultant in Dubai do? | A property consultant helps you make informed decisions about buying, selling, renting, or investing. This includes market research, property shortlisting, price negotiation, paperwork guidance, and introductions to mortgage lenders. Raihan Shaikh helps clients navigate these decisions with practical advice and a focus on their property goals.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How can I buy property in Dubai as a foreigner? | Foreigners can buy freehold property in designated areas of Dubai. The usual steps include setting a budget, shortlisting properties, signing the sale agreement, paying a deposit, and completing the transfer at the Dubai Land Department. Working with a knowledgeable property consultant like Raihan Shaikh can help you understand the process and navigate each step.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What extra costs should I expect when buying property in Dubai? | Beyond the purchase price, expect the Dubai Land Department transfer fee, usually 4% of the price, plus agency fees, trustee office fees, and mortgage charges if you&#039;re financing. Fees vary by deal, so ask for a full cost breakdown before you sign anything.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What is the difference between a real estate agent, an agency, and a consultant in Dubai? | A real estate agent is a licensed individual who handles transactions. A real estate agency or company is the firm that employs agents. A property consultant focuses on advice, which means market analysis, strategy, and long-term planning, and often handles transactions too.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Can non-residents get a mortgage in Dubai? | Yes, many UAE banks lend to non-residents, though they often ask for a larger down payment than they do for residents. Rates and terms differ by bank and by your income profile, so comparing several offers is wise.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Can I get a Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai? | Qualifying property investors can apply for a long-term UAE residency, and the minimum property value has been AED 2 million. Requirements can change, so confirm the current rules with official sources or with your consultant before buying.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Is buying property in Dubai a good investment right now? | It can be, depending on the area, property type, and your goals. Dubai offers no personal income tax, a large rental market, and strong international demand. However, prices can rise and fall, so compare options carefully and consider your investment timeline. Raihan Shaikh can help buyers and investors assess suitable areas and property options based on their objectives.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Should I choose off-plan or ready property in Dubai? | Off-plan properties usually cost less upfront and offer staged payment plans, but you wait for completion and rely on the developer. Ready properties let you move in or start renting right away. The better choice depends on your budget, timeline, and risk comfort.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How do I contact Raihan Shaikh, and what happens in the first consultation? | Call +971 52 102 7252, email hello@realtorraihan.com, or use the form on this page. In the first conversation, we talk through your goals, budget, and timeline. Then I outline realistic options, and there&#039;s no pressure to commit.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 06:38:06','2026-11-23 06:38:06','',9,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=127',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (128,1,'2026-11-23 06:43:00','2026-11-23 06:43:00','<div class=\"invest-13-article\"><p class=\"invest-13-lede\">Discover the key reasons why Dubai continues to attract property buyers and investors from around the world. Explore the factors that shape the market and what to consider before making a property decision.</p><div class=\"invest-13-grid\"><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/sv-bg-skyline-1024x439.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">01</span><h2>Strategic Location</h2><p>Dubai sits where Europe, Asia, and Africa meet, and its airports connect to cities across the globe. That reach draws buyers, tenants, and businesses from everywhere, which keeps demand for homes and offices active.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-office-dusk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">02</span><h2>Stable Economy</h2><p>The city earns from trade, tourism, aviation, finance, and logistics, not from one industry alone. A mixed economy gives property owners a steadier base than markets that depend on a single sector.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/penthouse-living-sunset.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">03</span><h2>Tax-Free Environment</h2><p>The UAE has no personal income tax, so rental income and property gains are not taxed in your personal hands. Business activity can bring corporate tax or VAT into the picture, so I always suggest a quick word with a tax adviser.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-marina-night.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">04</span><h2>Thriving Rental Market</h2><p>Dubai has a large tenant population of professionals, families and newcomers. Rental yields are often higher than in many major global cities, though they vary by area and property type. I&#039;ll show you real figures for the Dubai property you&#039;re considering.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-2-marina-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">05</span><h2>Infrastructure Development</h2><p>Metro lines, new roads, airports, hospitals, and schools keep expanding. As connectivity across Dubai improves, the city becomes more attractive to live in and rent out.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-villa-evening.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">06</span><h2>World-Class Lifestyle</h2><p>Beaches, schools, healthcare, dining and entertainment are accessible across Dubai. That quality of life is what keeps tenants renewing and buyers arriving.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/villa-pool-terrace.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">07</span><h2>Freehold Ownership</h2><p>Foreign buyers can own freehold property outright in designated areas, with title registered at the Dubai Land Department. No local sponsor is needed for those homes.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/penthouse-terrace-dusk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">08</span><h2>Residency Through Property</h2><p>A qualifying property investment can support a renewable residency. The thresholds change, so we confirm the current rule before you commit.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/downtown-walk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">09</span><h2>Strong Developer Track Record</h2><p>Dubai&#039;s major developers deliver on schedule more often than not, and their escrow rules protect off-plan buyers. I only bring you developers I have seen hand over.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-4-sunset-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">10</span><h2>Currency Advantage</h2><p>The dirham is pegged to the US dollar, which removes one layer of exchange risk for many international buyers and makes rental income easier to plan.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-3-villa-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">11</span><h2>Transparent Regulation</h2><p>RERA licensing, escrow accounts and a public transaction register make Dubai one of the easier markets to verify. You can check almost everything I tell you.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-1-downtown-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">12</span><h2>Population Growth</h2><p>The city keeps adding residents, and each new arrival needs a home. Supply is catching up in some areas, which is exactly why property selection matters.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/marina-daylight.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">13</span><h2>Golden Visa Pathway</h2><p>Property is one of the routes to long-term residency, and it is the one most of my clients ask about first. We go through the conditions honestly.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div><a class=\"invest-13-card__link\" href=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/contact/\">Explore More <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article></div></div>','13 Reasons to Invest in Dubai','Discover the key reasons why Dubai continues to attract property buyers and investors from around the world.','inherit','closed','closed','','126-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 06:43:00','2026-11-23 06:43:00','',126,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=128',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (129,1,'2026-11-23 07:52:10','2026-11-23 07:52:10','<p>I purchased Emaar property through Mr. Raihan Shaikh and his knowledge, professionalism and experience were instrumental in helping us secure Corner Unit with a garden view that perfectly matched our requirements during the pre-launch stage. He took my wife and me to the Emaar showroom to review the project&#039;s 3D model and provided valuable guidance throughout the entire process. Mr. Raihan was supportive, responsive, and highly helpful from the initial project selection through to the successful completion of the sales agreement. Even after the agreement was signed, he continued to assist us with other related activities and provided Prompt support whenever required. I would strongly recommend Mr. Raihan to anyone looking to purchase a property in UAE. His dedication, customer focused approach, and commitment to ensuring a smooth buying experience make him an excellent Real Estate Advisor.</p>','Govind Rajan','','publish','closed','closed','','govind-rajan','','','2026-11-23 07:52:10','2026-11-23 07:52:10','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?post_type=testimonial&p=129',100,'testimonial','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (130,1,'2026-11-23 07:52:10','2026-11-23 07:52:10','<p>I have been dealing with Raihan Shaikh for the past two years, and during this time, he has helped me buy properties in Tilal Al Ghaf, as well as sell my other properties. Raihan has been consistently reliable and always available when I needed assistance. His deep understanding of the process made everything stress-free for me, especially since I&#039;m frequently traveling. I highly recommend Raihan.</p>','Smart Import Trading LLC','','publish','closed','closed','','smart-import-trading-llc','','','2026-11-23 07:52:10','2026-11-23 07:52:10','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?post_type=testimonial&p=130',100,'testimonial','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (131,1,'2026-11-23 08:10:06','2026-11-23 08:10:06','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Home Page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Hero (top of the page)</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant · Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh,</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your next property move deserves <b> the right advice..</b></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I\'m a professional property consultant in Dubai who helps people buy, sell, rent and invest with confidence. You get straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book A Free Consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Introduction and stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Introduction</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Turning Your Dubai Property\r\nGoals into Smart Real Estate\r\nInvestments</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Working with a Dubai real estate agent should feel clear and honest. Buy, sell, or rent with personal guidance from the first call to handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai moves fast. If you\'re buying here for the first time, the choices can feel endless. Prices change from one community to the next, paperwork has its own rules, and not every listing is as good as the photos suggest.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>That\'s where I come in. As a real estate agent in Dubai, I work with investors, families, and business owners to find properties that fit their budget and their goals. Then I stay with them through negotiation, financing, and handover. Tell me what you\'re after, and I\'ll tell you honestly what makes sense.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>YEARS IN DUBAI PROPERTY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Founder &amp; Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Years of Experience</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hands-on knowledge ofthe Dubai market</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>100+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Satisfied Clients</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers, sellers, landlords,and investors</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>10</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Locations Covered</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Popular communitiesacross Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>24/7</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Continuous Support &amp; Guidance</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Help before, during,and after the deal</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why invest in Dubai</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Invest</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Investors Choose \r\nDubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>People from all over the world invest in Dubai property for practical reasons. Here are the ones I explain to my clients most often.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>13</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>reasons clients ask about, in plain English</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Services</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What I Offer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Dubai Property Advisory</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Whether you want to buy, sell, rent, or invest in commercial real estate, I offer property consulting services in Dubai built around your situation. Here\'s how I can help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Client testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Client Success Stories</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Building trust through honest advice, personalized service, and successful property journeys in Dubai.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Names and identities are withheld until written consent is on file.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose me</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Choose Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Work  With Me</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Questions?\r\nI am Here To Help.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The things buyers, sellers and investors ask me most often about Dubai property, answered straight, with no sales gloss.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask Me Directly</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Contact</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Get In Touch</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Let\'s Find the Right Property for You</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send an enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Service cards</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sell Property | Thinking of selling your property in Dubai? I&#039;ll help you set a realistic price, present the home well, and reach serious buyers. I handle viewings, negotiate offers, and guide the paperwork through to closing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buy Property | I start with your budget, goals and timeline, then shortlist homes and investments that fit, share honest market insight and negotiate for you.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rent Property | I match tenants with suitable places and landlords with reliable tenants, and help with rental pricing, lease terms and the practical details.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Commercial | Offices, retail and industrial units need a different approach. I help owners and investors find space that fits, then negotiate protective terms.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mortgage Guidance | Dubai mortgages have their own rules for expats and non-residents. I explain your options, connect you with lenders and help you compare offers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Golden Visa Guidance | I explain how property investment can support a Golden Visa application and check the property meets current requirements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Business Setup | I explain the general process, point you to trusted setup partners and help you find the right office or commercial space.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bank Account Support | Opening a bank account is often the first hurdle for new investors in Dubai. I guide you through what banks usually ask for and introduce you to the right contacts, so your payments and transfers run smoothly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ questions and answers</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>1. What additional costs are generally involved when buying off-plan in Dubai? | Costs can vary by project and by developer. As a general guide, buyers often budget for:\r\n• DLD registration fee: Generally 4% of the purchase price, usually paid via Oqood registration. This\r\nis generally the main government registration fee, not an additional fee on top of Oqood.\r\n• Oqood and admin fees: Often around AED 4,020 for DLD admin, plus small knowledge and\r\ninnovation fees. These amounts may change.\r\n• Developer admin fee: Varies by developer and project. Some developers may waive it as part of a\r\nlaunch offer. Ask for it in writing before booking.\r\nYour instalments after booking are generally paid according to the payment plan in your Sales and\r\nPurchase Agreement (SPA). Always check your own SPA.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What does a property consultant in Dubai do? | A property consultant helps you make informed decisions about buying, selling, renting, or investing. This includes market research, property shortlisting, price negotiation, paperwork guidance, and introductions to mortgage lenders. Raihan Shaikh helps clients navigate these decisions with practical advice and a focus on their property goals.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How can I buy property in Dubai as a foreigner? | Foreigners can buy freehold property in designated areas of Dubai. The usual steps include setting a budget, shortlisting properties, signing the sale agreement, paying a deposit, and completing the transfer at the Dubai Land Department. Working with a knowledgeable property consultant like Raihan Shaikh can help you understand the process and navigate each step.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What extra costs should I expect when buying property in Dubai? | Beyond the purchase price, expect the Dubai Land Department transfer fee, usually 4% of the price, plus agency fees, trustee office fees, and mortgage charges if you&#039;re financing. Fees vary by deal, so ask for a full cost breakdown before you sign anything.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What is the difference between a real estate agent, an agency, and a consultant in Dubai? | A real estate agent is a licensed individual who handles transactions. A real estate agency or company is the firm that employs agents. A property consultant focuses on advice, which means market analysis, strategy, and long-term planning, and often handles transactions too.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Can non-residents get a mortgage in Dubai? | Yes, many UAE banks lend to non-residents, though they often ask for a larger down payment than they do for residents. Rates and terms differ by bank and by your income profile, so comparing several offers is wise.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Can I get a Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai? | Qualifying property investors can apply for a long-term UAE residency, and the minimum property value has been AED 2 million. Requirements can change, so confirm the current rules with official sources or with your consultant before buying.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Is buying property in Dubai a good investment right now? | It can be, depending on the area, property type, and your goals. Dubai offers no personal income tax, a large rental market, and strong international demand. However, prices can rise and fall, so compare options carefully and consider your investment timeline. Raihan Shaikh can help buyers and investors assess suitable areas and property options based on their objectives.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Should I choose off-plan or ready property in Dubai? | Off-plan properties usually cost less upfront and offer staged payment plans, but you wait for completion and rely on the developer. Ready properties let you move in or start renting right away. The better choice depends on your budget, timeline, and risk comfort.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How do I contact Raihan Shaikh, and what happens in the first consultation? | Call +971 52 102 7252, email hello@realtorraihan.com, or use the form on this page. In the first conversation, we talk through your goals, budget, and timeline. Then I outline realistic options, and there&#039;s no pressure to commit.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 08:10:06','2026-11-23 08:10:06','',9,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=131',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (132,0,'2026-11-23 09:26:16','2026-11-23 09:26:16','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Home Page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Hero (top of the page)</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant · Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh,</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your next property move deserves <b> the right advice..</b></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I\'m a professional property consultant in Dubai who helps people buy, sell, rent and invest with confidence. You get straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book A Free Consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Introduction and stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Introduction</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Turning Your Dubai Property\r\nGoals into Smart Real Estate\r\nInvestments</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Working with a Dubai real estate agent should feel clear and honest. Buy, sell, or rent with personal guidance from the first call to handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai moves fast. If you\'re buying here for the first time, the choices can feel endless. Prices change from one community to the next, paperwork has its own rules, and not every listing is as good as the photos suggest.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>That\'s where I come in. As a real estate agent in Dubai, I work with investors, families, and business owners to find properties that fit their budget and their goals. Then I stay with them through negotiation, financing, and handover. Tell me what you\'re after, and I\'ll tell you honestly what makes sense.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>YEARS IN DUBAI PROPERTY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Founder &amp; Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Years of Experience</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hands-on knowledge ofthe Dubai market</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>100+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Satisfied Clients</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers, sellers, landlords,and investors</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>10</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Locations Covered</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Popular communitiesacross Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>24/7</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Continuous Support &amp; Guidance</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Help before, during,and after the deal</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why invest in Dubai</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Invest</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Investors Choose \r\nDubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>People from all over the world invest in Dubai property for practical reasons. Here are the ones I explain to my clients most often.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>13</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>reasons clients ask about, in plain English</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Services</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What I Offer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Dubai Property Advisory</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Whether you want to buy, sell, rent, or invest in commercial real estate, I offer property consulting services in Dubai built around your situation. Here\'s how I can help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Client testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Client Success Stories</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Building trust through honest advice, personalized service, and successful property journeys in Dubai.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Names and identities are withheld until written consent is on file.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose me</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Choose Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Work  With Me</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Questions?\r\nI am Here To Help.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The things buyers, sellers and investors ask me most often about Dubai property, answered straight, with no sales gloss.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask Me Directly</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Contact</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Get In Touch</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Let\'s Find the Right Property for You</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send an enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Service cards</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sell Property | Thinking of selling your property in Dubai? I&#039;ll help you set a realistic price, present the home well, and reach serious buyers. I handle viewings, negotiate offers, and guide the paperwork through to closing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buy Property | I start with your budget, goals and timeline, then shortlist homes and investments that fit, share honest market insight and negotiate for you.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rent Property | I match tenants with suitable places and landlords with reliable tenants, and help with rental pricing, lease terms and the practical details.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Commercial | Offices, retail and industrial units need a different approach. I help owners and investors find space that fits, then negotiate protective terms.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mortgage Guidance | Dubai mortgages have their own rules for expats and non-residents. I explain your options, connect you with lenders and help you compare offers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Golden Visa Guidance | I explain how property investment can support a Golden Visa application and check the property meets current requirements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Business Setup | I explain the general process, point you to trusted setup partners and help you find the right office or commercial space.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bank Account Support | Opening a bank account is often the first hurdle for new investors in Dubai. I guide you through what banks usually ask for and introduce you to the right contacts, so your payments and transfers run smoothly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ questions and answers</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying off-plan in Dubai? | Costs can vary by project and by developer. As a general guide, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD registration fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price, usually paid via Oqood registration. This is generally the main government registration fee, not an additional fee on top of Oqood.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Oqood and admin fees:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 4,020 for DLD admin, plus small knowledge and innovation fees. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer admin fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and project. Some developers may waive it as part of a launch offer. Ask for it in writing before booking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your instalments after booking are generally paid according to the payment plan in your Sales and Purchase Agreement (SPA). Always check your own SPA.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying a ready or secondary property in Dubai? | For a completed resale property, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD transfer fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Trustee office fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Often AED 2,000 plus VAT for properties below AED 500,000, and AED 4,000 plus VAT for properties at AED 500,000 and above. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Title deed issuance:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 580.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Agency commission:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around 2% of the price plus 5% VAT on a secondary purchase. The exact commission should be agreed in writing before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer NOC fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and community. Your agent can help you confirm the current amount before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Mortgage costs, if financed:&lt;/strong&gt; Mortgage registration is generally 0.25% of the loan amount plus AED 290 admin, plus bank valuation and processing fees, subject to the bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a general guide only, many cash buyers budget around 7% to 8% on top of the price for a resale purchase. Your actual total will depend on your property, your financing and your contract.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How are off-plan payments generally handled? Are they protected? | Under Dubai Law No. 8 of 2007, registered off-plan projects are generally required to have a dedicated escrow account with an approved UAE bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your payments are generally required to go into that project escrow account, not into an agent personal account or a general developer account. The account is generally named in your SPA. Before you pay, verify the escrow account details in your SPA and on the DLD project record, and always keep your payment receipts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Escrow is designed to reduce risk. It does not remove all investment risk. Always check the developer track record and project status, and consider independent advice.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Is it possible to get a UAE visa or Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai? | It may be possible, subject to approval and current authority requirements. A purchase does not automatically give you a visa.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10-Year Golden Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; You may be eligible if you own property worth AED 2 million or more. This may be one property or a portfolio in your name. Mortgaged property may qualify with a bank letter or NOC confirming at least AED 2 million has been paid, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-Year Property Investor Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; If you are the sole owner of a completed property, there may currently be no minimum property value requirement. If the property is jointly owned, each investor may need to hold a share worth at least AED 400,000 to qualify, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Visas are not guaranteed with purchase. You must still meet medical, insurance, documentation and authority approval requirements. Confirm your eligibility before booking if a visa is a main reason for buying.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How can I generally verify a developer and project before I pay? | Before booking, consider checking:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Whether the project is registered with DLD and has an active escrow account.&lt;br&gt;• Whether the developer name, project name and escrow account in your SPA match the DLD record.&lt;br&gt;• The developer track record for delivery, quality and handover.&lt;br&gt;• The payment plan, handover date, grace period and resale or NOC terms in the SPA.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A genuine agent should be willing to share the SPA, project registration details and escrow information before asking for payment. Do not rely only on marketing material.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 09:26:16','2026-11-23 09:26:16','',9,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=132',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (133,1,'2026-11-23 09:38:46','2026-11-23 09:38:46','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or About page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Page banner</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Raihan Shaikh</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>About section</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Raihan ShaikhProperty Consultant Dubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/image-9.png</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I am Raihan Shaikh, a senior property consultant in Dubai with Homes 4 Life Real Estate. Five years in this market has taught me one thing: the deal is easy, the decision is hard. So I work the decision first. What the service charge actually costs, what the rental cheques really look like, what resale looks like four years out.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Most of my clients start in Business Bay, Downtown or Dubai Marina and end up somewhere they did not expect: JVC, Arjan, a villa in Damac Hills. That is fine. My job is not to sell you a building. It is to make sure the one you pick still makes sense to you in 2030, not just on the day you sign.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If a deal is not right for you, I will say so. There is always another one.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>More about us</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose us</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why choose us</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>What you get that a portalpage cannot give you.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>villa-pool-terrace.webp</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Badge on the photo</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+ years</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>in the Dubai market, from Business Bay to Damac Hills.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Closing call to action</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Let\'s talk</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Tell me what you\'re after and I\'ll tell you honestly.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One call, no pitch. Bring your budget and your timeline. I will bring the numbers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book a free consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>WhatsApp me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four points on the About page</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Trusted property experts | Five years, one market, real transactions. Every number I quote can be checked against the DLD register. I would rather you verify me than take my word for it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Access before the portal | Off-plan launches, resale units and negotiated prices often move before an advert goes live. You hear about them from me first, with the payment plan attached.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A process with no surprises | Reservation, DLD fees, NOC, trustee transfer, snagging. You get the full checklist up front with the costs written next to each line, not after the deposit.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>One number that answers | No call centre, no rotating agents. You deal with me from the first WhatsApp to the handover, and after it, when the tenant or the resale question comes up.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','About','','inherit','closed','closed','','7-autosave-v1','','','2026-11-23 09:38:46','2026-11-23 09:38:46','',7,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=133',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (134,1,'2026-11-23 09:53:13','2026-11-23 09:53:13','<div class=\"invest-13-article\"><p class=\"invest-13-lede\">Discover the key reasons why Dubai continues to attract property buyers and investors from around the world. Explore the factors that shape the market and what to consider before making a property decision.</p><div class=\"invest-13-grid\"><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/sv-bg-skyline-1024x439.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">01</span><h2>Strategic Location</h2><p>Dubai sits where Europe, Asia, and Africa meet, and its airports connect to cities across the globe. That reach draws buyers, tenants, and businesses from everywhere, which keeps demand for homes and offices active.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-office-dusk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">02</span><h2>Stable Economy</h2><p>The city earns from trade, tourism, aviation, finance, and logistics, not from one industry alone. A mixed economy gives property owners a steadier base than markets that depend on a single sector.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/penthouse-living-sunset.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">03</span><h2>Tax-Free Environment</h2><p>The UAE has no personal income tax, so rental income and property gains are not taxed in your personal hands. Business activity can bring corporate tax or VAT into the picture, so I always suggest a quick word with a tax adviser.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-marina-night.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">04</span><h2>Thriving Rental Market</h2><p>Dubai has a large tenant population of professionals, families and newcomers. Rental yields are often higher than in many major global cities, though they vary by area and property type. I&#039;ll show you real figures for the Dubai property you&#039;re considering.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-2-marina-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">05</span><h2>Infrastructure Development</h2><p>Metro lines, new roads, airports, hospitals, and schools keep expanding. As connectivity across Dubai improves, the city becomes more attractive to live in and rent out.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/gen-villa-evening.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">06</span><h2>World-Class Lifestyle</h2><p>Beaches, schools, healthcare, dining and entertainment are accessible across Dubai. That quality of life is what keeps tenants renewing and buyers arriving.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/villa-pool-terrace.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">07</span><h2>Freehold Ownership</h2><p>Foreign buyers can own freehold property outright in designated areas, with title registered at the Dubai Land Department. No local sponsor is needed for those homes.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/penthouse-terrace-dusk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">08</span><h2>Residency Through Property</h2><p>A qualifying property investment can support a renewable residency. The thresholds change, so we confirm the current rule before you commit.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/downtown-walk.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">09</span><h2>Strong Developer Track Record</h2><p>Dubai&#039;s major developers deliver on schedule more often than not, and their escrow rules protect off-plan buyers. I only bring you developers I have seen hand over.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-4-sunset-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">10</span><h2>Currency Advantage</h2><p>The dirham is pegged to the US dollar, which removes one layer of exchange risk for many international buyers and makes rental income easier to plan.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-3-villa-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">11</span><h2>Transparent Regulation</h2><p>RERA licensing, escrow accounts and a public transaction register make Dubai one of the easier markets to verify. You can check almost everything I tell you.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/hero-1-downtown-1024x576.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">12</span><h2>Population Growth</h2><p>The city keeps adding residents, and each new arrival needs a home. Supply is catching up in some areas, which is exactly why property selection matters.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article><article class=\"invest-13-card\"><div class=\"invest-13-card__image\"><img src=\"https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/marina-daylight.webp\" alt=\"Premium Dubai real estate - Dubai premium real estate photography\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div class=\"invest-13-card__body\"><span class=\"invest-13-card__number\">13</span><h2>Golden Visa Pathway</h2><p>Property is one of the routes to long-term residency, and it is the one most of my clients ask about first. We go through the conditions honestly.</p><div class=\"invest-13-card__rule\"></div></div></article></div></div>','13 Reasons to Invest in Dubai','Discover the key reasons why Dubai continues to attract property buyers and investors from around the world.','inherit','closed','closed','','126-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 09:53:13','2026-11-23 09:53:13','',126,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=134',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (135,1,'2026-11-23 09:55:55','2026-11-23 09:55:55','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Home Page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Hero (top of the page)</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant · Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh,</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your next property move deserves <b> the right advice..</b></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I\'m a professional property consultant in Dubai who helps people buy, sell, rent and invest with confidence. You get straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book A Free Consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Introduction and stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Introduction</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Turning Your Dubai Property\nGoals into Smart Real Estate\nInvestments</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Working with a Dubai real estate agent should feel clear and honest. Buy, sell, or rent with personal guidance from the first call to handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai moves fast. If you\'re buying here for the first time, the choices can feel endless. Prices change from one community to the next, paperwork has its own rules, and not every listing is as good as the photos suggest.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>That\'s where I come in. As a real estate agent in Dubai, I work with investors, families, and business owners to find properties that fit their budget and their goals. Then I stay with them through negotiation, financing, and handover. Tell me what you\'re after, and I\'ll tell you honestly what makes sense.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>YEARS IN DUBAI PROPERTY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Founder &amp; Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Years of Experience</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hands-on knowledge ofthe Dubai market</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>100+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Satisfied Clients</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers, sellers, landlords,and investors</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>10</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Locations Covered</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Popular communitiesacross Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>24/7</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Continuous Support &amp; Guidance</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Help before, during,and after the deal</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why invest in Dubai</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Invest</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Investors Choose \nDubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>People from all over the world invest in Dubai property for practical reasons. Here are the ones I explain to my clients most often.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>13</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>reasons clients ask about, in plain English</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Services</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What I Offer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Dubai Property Advisory</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Whether you want to buy, sell, rent, or invest in commercial real estate, I offer property consulting services in Dubai built around your situation. Here\'s how I can help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Client testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Client Success Stories</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Building trust through honest advice, personalized service, and successful property journeys in Dubai.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Names and identities are withheld until written consent is on file.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose me</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Choose Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Work  With Me</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Questions?\nI am Here To Help.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The things buyers, sellers and investors ask me most often about Dubai property, answered straight, with no sales gloss.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask Me Directly</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Contact</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Get In Touch</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Let\'s Find the Right Property for You</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send an enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Service cards</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sell Property | Thinking of selling your property in Dubai? I&#039;ll help you set a realistic price, present the home well, and reach serious buyers. I handle viewings, negotiate offers, and guide the paperwork through to closing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buy Property | I start with your budget, goals and timeline, then shortlist homes and investments that fit, share honest market insight and negotiate for you.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rent Property | I match tenants with suitable places and landlords with reliable tenants, and help with rental pricing, lease terms and the practical details.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Commercial | Offices, retail and industrial units need a different approach. I help owners and investors find space that fits, then negotiate protective terms.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mortgage Guidance | Dubai mortgages have their own rules for expats and non-residents. I explain your options, connect you with lenders and help you compare offers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Golden Visa Guidance | I explain how property investment can support a Golden Visa application and check the property meets current requirements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Business Setup | I explain the general process, point you to trusted setup partners and help you find the right office or commercial space.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bank Account Support | Opening a bank account is often the first hurdle for new investors in Dubai. I guide you through what banks usually ask for and introduce you to the right contacts, so your payments and transfers run smoothly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ questions and answers</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying off-plan in Dubai? | Costs can vary by project and by developer. As a general guide, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD registration fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price, usually paid via Oqood registration. This is generally the main government registration fee, not an additional fee on top of Oqood.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Oqood and admin fees:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 4,020 for DLD admin, plus small knowledge and innovation fees. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer admin fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and project. Some developers may waive it as part of a launch offer. Ask for it in writing before booking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your instalments after booking are generally paid according to the payment plan in your Sales and Purchase Agreement (SPA). Always check your own SPA.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying a ready or secondary property in Dubai? | For a completed resale property, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD transfer fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Trustee office fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Often AED 2,000 plus VAT for properties below AED 500,000, and AED 4,000 plus VAT for properties at AED 500,000 and above. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Title deed issuance:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 580.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Agency commission:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around 2% of the price plus 5% VAT on a secondary purchase. The exact commission should be agreed in writing before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer NOC fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and community. Your agent can help you confirm the current amount before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Mortgage costs, if financed:&lt;/strong&gt; Mortgage registration is generally 0.25% of the loan amount plus AED 290 admin, plus bank valuation and processing fees, subject to the bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a general guide only, many cash buyers budget around 7% to 8% on top of the price for a resale purchase. Your actual total will depend on your property, your financing and your contract.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How are off-plan payments generally handled? Are they protected? | Under Dubai Law No. 8 of 2007, registered off-plan projects are generally required to have a dedicated escrow account with an approved UAE bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your payments are generally required to go into that project escrow account, not into an agent personal account or a general developer account. The account is generally named in your SPA. Before you pay, verify the escrow account details in your SPA and on the DLD project record, and always keep your payment receipts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Escrow is designed to reduce risk. It does not remove all investment risk. Always check the developer track record and project status, and consider independent advice.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Is it possible to get a UAE visa or Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai? | It may be possible, subject to approval and current authority requirements. A purchase does not automatically give you a visa.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10-Year Golden Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; You may be eligible if you own property worth AED 2 million or more. This may be one property or a portfolio in your name. Mortgaged property may qualify with a bank letter or NOC confirming at least AED 2 million has been paid, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-Year Property Investor Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; If you are the sole owner of a completed property, there may currently be no minimum property value requirement. If the property is jointly owned, each investor may need to hold a share worth at least AED 400,000 to qualify, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Visas are not guaranteed with purchase. You must still meet medical, insurance, documentation and authority approval requirements. Confirm your eligibility before booking if a visa is a main reason for buying.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How can I generally verify a developer and project before I pay? | Before booking, consider checking:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Whether the project is registered with DLD and has an active escrow account.&lt;br&gt;• Whether the developer name, project name and escrow account in your SPA match the DLD record.&lt;br&gt;• The developer track record for delivery, quality and handover.&lt;br&gt;• The payment plan, handover date, grace period and resale or NOC terms in the SPA.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A genuine agent should be willing to share the SPA, project registration details and escrow information before asking for payment. Do not rely only on marketing material.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-autosave-v1','','','2026-11-23 09:55:55','2026-11-23 09:55:55','',9,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=135',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (136,1,'2026-11-23 10:28:32','2026-11-23 10:28:32','','Real Estate Excellence Crystal Award','','inherit','open','closed','','real-estate-excellence-crystal-award','','','2026-11-23 10:28:32','2026-11-23 10:28:32','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Real-Estate-Excellence-Crystal-Award.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (137,0,'2026-11-23 10:52:04','2026-11-23 10:52:04','<!-- wp:paragraph --><p><em>This page is built by the theme. The text below is the live content, refreshed every time you save. You can read it here, but the safe place to change it is the boxes in &quot;Content of this page&quot; below (or Home Page in the left menu).</em></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Hero (top of the page)</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant · Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh,</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your next property move deserves <b> the right advice..</b></p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I\'m a professional property consultant in Dubai who helps people buy, sell, rent and invest with confidence. You get straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Book A Free Consultation</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>About Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Introduction and stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Introduction</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Turning Your Dubai Property\r\nGoals into Smart Real Estate\r\nInvestments</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Working with a Dubai real estate agent should feel clear and honest. Buy, sell, or rent with personal guidance from the first call to handover.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Dubai moves fast. If you\'re buying here for the first time, the choices can feel endless. Prices change from one community to the next, paperwork has its own rules, and not every listing is as good as the photos suggest.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>That\'s where I come in. As a real estate agent in Dubai, I work with investors, families, and business owners to find properties that fit their budget and their goals. Then I stay with them through negotiation, financing, and handover. Tell me what you\'re after, and I\'ll tell you honestly what makes sense.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straight answers, real numbers, and someone who picks up the phone.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>YEARS IN DUBAI PROPERTY</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Raihan Shaikh</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Founder &amp; Property Consultant</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>The four stats</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>5+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Years of Experience</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hands-on knowledge ofthe Dubai market</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>100+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Satisfied Clients</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buyers, sellers, landlords,and investors</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>10</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Locations Covered</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Popular communitiesacross Dubai</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>24/7</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Continuous Support &amp; Guidance</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Help before, during,and after the deal</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why invest in Dubai</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Invest</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Investors Choose \r\nDubai</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>People from all over the world invest in Dubai property for practical reasons. Here are the ones I explain to my clients most often.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>13</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>reasons clients ask about, in plain English</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Services</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What I Offer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Dubai Property Advisory</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Whether you want to buy, sell, rent, or invest in commercial real estate, I offer property consulting services in Dubai built around your situation. Here\'s how I can help.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Client testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Client Success Stories</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Building trust through honest advice, personalized service, and successful property journeys in Dubai.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Names and identities are withheld until written consent is on file.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Why choose me</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Why Choose Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Why Choose Me?</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Contact Me</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Questions?\r\nI am Here To Help.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The things buyers, sellers and investors ask me most often about Dubai property, answered straight, with no sales gloss.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask Me Directly</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Contact</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Get In Touch</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2>Let\'s Find the Right Property for You</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell me what you\'re planning and I\'ll come back with honest options, no pressure, no jargon. If you\'d rather talk it through, call or message me directly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Send an enquiry</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fill this in and I\'ll reply personally, usually the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Service cards</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Sell Property | Thinking of selling your property in Dubai? I&#039;ll help you set a realistic price, present the home well, and reach serious buyers. I handle viewings, negotiate offers, and guide the paperwork through to closing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Buy Property | I start with your budget, goals and timeline, then shortlist homes and investments that fit, share honest market insight and negotiate for you.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Rent Property | I match tenants with suitable places and landlords with reliable tenants, and help with rental pricing, lease terms and the practical details.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Commercial | Offices, retail and industrial units need a different approach. I help owners and investors find space that fits, then negotiate protective terms.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mortgage Guidance | Dubai mortgages have their own rules for expats and non-residents. I explain your options, connect you with lenders and help you compare offers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Golden Visa Guidance | I explain how property investment can support a Golden Visa application and check the property meets current requirements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Business Setup | I explain the general process, point you to trusted setup partners and help you find the right office or commercial space.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bank Account Support | Opening a bank account is often the first hurdle for new investors in Dubai. I guide you through what banks usually ask for and introduce you to the right contacts, so your payments and transfers run smoothly.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>Testimonials</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p> | </p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3>FAQ questions and answers</h3><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying off-plan in Dubai? | Costs can vary by project and by developer. As a general guide, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD registration fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price, usually paid via Oqood registration. This is generally the main government registration fee, not an additional fee on top of Oqood.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Oqood and admin fees:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 4,020 for DLD admin, plus small knowledge and innovation fees. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer admin fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and project. Some developers may waive it as part of a launch offer. Ask for it in writing before booking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your instalments after booking are generally paid according to the payment plan in your Sales and Purchase Agreement (SPA). Always check your own SPA.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What additional costs are generally involved when buying a ready or secondary property in Dubai? | For a completed resale property, buyers often budget for:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• DLD transfer fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Generally 4% of the purchase price.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Trustee office fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Often AED 2,000 plus VAT for properties below AED 500,000, and AED 4,000 plus VAT for properties at AED 500,000 and above. These amounts may change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Title deed issuance:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around AED 580.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Agency commission:&lt;/strong&gt; Often around 2% of the price plus 5% VAT on a secondary purchase. The exact commission should be agreed in writing before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Developer NOC fee:&lt;/strong&gt; Varies by developer and community. Your agent can help you confirm the current amount before transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;• Mortgage costs, if financed:&lt;/strong&gt; Mortgage registration is generally 0.25% of the loan amount plus AED 290 admin, plus bank valuation and processing fees, subject to the bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a general guide only, many cash buyers budget around 7% to 8% on top of the price for a resale purchase. Your actual total will depend on your property, your financing and your contract.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How are off-plan payments generally handled? Are they protected? | Under Dubai Law No. 8 of 2007, registered off-plan projects are generally required to have a dedicated escrow account with an approved UAE bank.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your payments are generally required to go into that project escrow account, not into an agent personal account or a general developer account. The account is generally named in your SPA. Before you pay, verify the escrow account details in your SPA and on the DLD project record, and always keep your payment receipts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Escrow is designed to reduce risk. It does not remove all investment risk. Always check the developer track record and project status, and consider independent advice.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Is it possible to get a UAE visa or Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai? | It may be possible, subject to approval and current authority requirements. A purchase does not automatically give you a visa.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10-Year Golden Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; You may be eligible if you own property worth AED 2 million or more. This may be one property or a portfolio in your name. Mortgaged property may qualify with a bank letter or NOC confirming at least AED 2 million has been paid, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-Year Property Investor Visa:&lt;/strong&gt; If you are the sole owner of a completed property, there may currently be no minimum property value requirement. If the property is jointly owned, each investor may need to hold a share worth at least AED 400,000 to qualify, subject to current requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Visas are not guaranteed with purchase. You must still meet medical, insurance, documentation and authority approval requirements. Confirm your eligibility before booking if a visa is a main reason for buying.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>How can I generally verify a developer and project before I pay? | Before booking, consider checking:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Whether the project is registered with DLD and has an active escrow account.&lt;br&gt;• Whether the developer name, project name and escrow account in your SPA match the DLD record.&lt;br&gt;• The developer track record for delivery, quality and handover.&lt;br&gt;• The payment plan, handover date, grace period and resale or NOC terms in the SPA.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A genuine agent should be willing to share the SPA, project registration details and escrow information before asking for payment. Do not rely only on marketing material.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-11-23 10:52:04','2026-11-23 10:52:04','',9,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=137',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (138,1,'2026-11-23 12:10:15','2026-11-23 12:10:15','<p>Buying in Dubai is straightforward when you know the full cost, the payment process, and your protections. These answers cover off-plan and ready property for local and overseas buyers.</p>\n<div class=\"rr-faq-disclaimer\"><strong>Please read first:</strong> This page is general information only. It is not legal, tax, financial, mortgage, investment or immigration advice. It is not an offer to sell, buy or rent any property, and it is not a guarantee of any outcome. Rules, fees and visa requirements can change. Always confirm figures, eligibility and contract terms with the Dubai Land Department (DLD), RERA, your bank, or a licensed professional before you make a payment or sign anything.</div>\n<p><em>Last updated: November 2026</em></p>\n<div class=\"rr-faq-accordion\"><details class=\"rr-faq-item\" open><summary><span>1. What additional costs are generally involved when buying off-plan in Dubai?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>Costs can vary by project and by developer. As a general guide, buyers often budget for:</p><ul><li>DLD registration fee: Generally 4% of the purchase price, usually paid via Oqood registration. This is generally the main government registration fee, not an additional fee on top of Oqood.</li><li>Oqood and admin fees: Often around AED 4,020 for DLD admin, plus small knowledge and innovation fees. These amounts may change.</li><li>Developer admin fee: Varies by developer and project. Some developers may waive it as part of a launch offer. Ask for it in writing before booking.</li></ul><p>Your instalments after booking are generally paid according to the payment plan in your Sales and Purchase Agreement (SPA). Always check your own SPA.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>2. What additional costs are generally involved when buying a ready or secondary property in Dubai?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>For a completed resale property, buyers often budget for:</p><ul><li>DLD transfer fee: Generally 4% of the purchase price.</li><li>Trustee office fee: Often AED 2,000 plus VAT for properties below AED 500,000, and AED 4,000 plus VAT for properties at AED 500,000 and above. These amounts may change.</li><li>Title deed issuance: Often around AED 580.</li><li>Agency commission: Often around 2% of the price plus 5% VAT on a secondary purchase. The exact commission should be agreed in writing before transfer.</li><li>Developer NOC fee: Varies by developer and community. Your agent can help you confirm the current amount before transfer.</li><li>Mortgage costs, if financed: Mortgage registration is generally 0.25% of the loan amount plus AED 290 admin, plus bank valuation and processing fees, subject to the bank.</li></ul><p>As a general guide only, many cash buyers budget around 7% to 8% on top of the price for a resale purchase. Your actual total will depend on your property, your financing and your contract.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>3. Is it possible to sell an off-plan property before completion?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>In many cases, yes, but it depends on your SPA and the developer. Many developers may allow resale once you have paid around 30% to 40% of the price and settled the DLD fee. You may also need a developer No Objection Certificate (NOC) and you may need to pay an assignment or NOC fee. The threshold, fee and process can vary by developer and project. If a possible early exit matters to you, confirm these terms in your SPA before you buy.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>4. What generally happens if the developer delays the project or the project is cancelled?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>Delays are generally handled under your SPA. Many SPAs include a grace period for handover. Check the exact clause in your own SPA.</p><p>For registered off-plan projects, buyer payments are generally required to go into a project-specific escrow account supervised under the RERA framework. Funds are generally intended to be released to the developer only against certified construction progress.</p><p>If RERA cancels a project by a final decision, refunds are generally handled through the escrow process. The timing, process and amount can vary and may depend on the official cancellation process and what is available in escrow. No specific refund amount or timeline is guaranteed.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>5. What generally happens to Dubai property if the owner passes away? Who may inherit it?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>This can depend on faith, family circumstances, and whether a valid will is registered. It can be complex. Independent legal advice is recommended.</p><p>For Muslim owners, Sharia succession rules may generally apply.</p><p>For non-Muslim owners, Federal Decree-Law No. 41 of 2022 may allow you to leave your UAE assets to persons you choose in a will. Without a will, the estate may generally be divided with half to the surviving spouse and half split equally among the children, subject to the applicable law.</p><p>Non-Muslim owners often register a will with the DIFC Wills Service or a notarised will at Dubai Courts. If you own property in Dubai, consider speaking to a licensed wills and succession lawyer about your family situation.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>6. What generally happens if property prices fall after I buy off-plan?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>In general, the SPA remains binding subject to its terms. A fall in market value does not automatically cancel the contract or reduce the balance you agreed to pay.</p><p>Plan for this risk before booking. If you are using a mortgage, note that the bank may value the property at handover, and a lower valuation may create a gap you need to cover in cash. Speak to your bank about this risk.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>7. How are off-plan payments generally handled? Are they protected?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>Under Dubai Law No. 8 of 2007, registered off-plan projects are generally required to have a dedicated escrow account with an approved UAE bank.</p><p>Your payments are generally required to go into that project escrow account, not into an agent personal account or a general developer account. The account is generally named in your SPA. Before you pay, verify the escrow account details in your SPA and on the DLD project record, and always keep your payment receipts.</p><p>Escrow is designed to reduce risk. It does not remove all investment risk. Always check the developer track record and project status, and consider independent advice.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>8. Is it generally possible to buy a Dubai property without visiting Dubai?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>In many cases, yes. Many overseas buyers complete much of the off-plan process remotely.</p><p>For off-plan, you may be able to reserve, sign the SPA electronically, and complete Oqood registration with a copy of your passport, subject to developer and KYC requirements. For a ready or resale property, a representative may be able to sign at the trustee office under a Power of Attorney (POA).</p><p>A POA signed abroad generally needs to be notarised, legalised and attested for use in the UAE, so allow time for this. You may still need to visit Dubai later for visa biometrics, or for opening a UAE bank account or mortgage, depending on your case.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>9. What generally happens if I miss an off-plan instalment?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>Do not ignore it. Contact your developer and your agent as soon as possible.</p><p>The process generally involves:</p><ul><li>Step 1: The developer notifies the Dubai Land Department (DLD) of the default.</li><li>Step 2: DLD may serve an official 30-day notice to settle the amount or reach a settlement.</li><li>Step 3: If you do not pay or settle within that period, the developer may seek to cancel the agreement under the statutory process.</li></ul><p>If the contract is cancelled, the developer may seek to retain a portion based on construction progress, generally up to 25% if construction is below 60% and up to 40% if construction is between 60% and 80%. Above 80%, the developer may instead seek the balance, ask DLD to auction the unit, or terminate under the same cap, subject to the law and your SPA. Any balance, if payable, is generally handled under that process.</p><p>Your SPA may also include late payment penalties. Acting early, for example by seeking a settlement or a possible resale before termination, is often better than waiting. Seek independent advice if you are in this situation.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>10. Is it possible to get a UAE visa or Golden Visa by buying property in Dubai?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>It may be possible, subject to approval and current authority requirements. A purchase does not automatically give you a visa.</p><p>10-Year Golden Visa: You may be eligible if you own property worth AED 2 million or more. This may be one property or a portfolio in your name. Mortgaged property may qualify with a bank letter or NOC confirming at least AED 2 million has been paid, subject to current requirements.</p><p>2-Year Property Investor Visa: If you are the sole owner of a completed property, there may currently be no minimum property value requirement. If the property is jointly owned, each investor may need to hold a share worth at least AED 400,000 to qualify, subject to current requirements.</p><p>Visas are not guaranteed with purchase. You must still meet medical, insurance, documentation and authority approval requirements. Confirm your eligibility before booking if a visa is a main reason for buying.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>11. What ongoing costs should I generally expect after handover?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><ul><li>Service charges: Generally charged per sq. ft. per year and can vary by building and community. They may cover maintenance, security, common areas, and community facilities. Ask for the current service charge for your exact unit before booking.</li><li>Utility connection: DEWA deposit and connection fees at handover may apply.</li><li>Property management: If you plan to rent it out, management fees may apply if you use a property manager.</li></ul><p>Ask for the service charge, expected handover fees and first-year running costs in writing before you commit.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>12. Is it generally possible for a non-resident to get a mortgage in Dubai?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>In many cases, yes, but terms are often stricter than for residents and approval is not guaranteed. Banks generally require proof of income, bank statements, proof of address, and a good credit history. Loan-to-value ratios for non-residents are often lower, and interest rates and fees can vary by bank and applicant. If you need finance, consider getting a pre-approval or at least a bank eligibility check before you reserve, especially for off-plan purchases where instalments are time-bound.</p></div></details><details class=\"rr-faq-item\"><summary><span>13. How can I generally verify a developer and project before I pay?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"rr-faq-answer\"><p>Before booking, consider checking:</p><ul><li>Whether the project is registered with DLD and has an active escrow account.</li><li>Whether the developer name, project name and escrow account in your SPA match the DLD record.</li><li>The developer track record for delivery, quality and handover.</li><li>The payment plan, handover date, grace period and resale or NOC terms in the SPA.</li></ul><p>A genuine agent should be willing to share the SPA, project registration details and escrow information before asking for payment. Do not rely only on marketing material.</p></div></details></div><section class=\"rr-faq-contact rr-faq-contact--split\" aria-labelledby=\"rr-faq-contact-title\">\n  <div class=\"rr-faq-contact__main\">\n    <p class=\"rr-faq-contact__eyebrow\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Personal Property Guidance</p>\n    <h2 id=\"rr-faq-contact-title\">Need clarity on a specific property?</h2>\n    <p class=\"rr-faq-contact__lead\">Speak directly with Raihan about a project, payment schedule or your next step in Dubai real estate.</p>\n    <div class=\"rr-faq-contact__actions\">\n      <a class=\"rr-faq-contact__btn rr-faq-contact__btn--primary\" href=\"tel:+971521027252\">Call Raihan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n      <a class=\"rr-faq-contact__btn rr-faq-contact__btn--secondary\" href=\"https://wa.me/971521027252\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WhatsApp <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rr-faq-contact__profile\" aria-label=\"Raihan Shaikh, Property Consultant in Dubai\">\n    <div class=\"rr-faq-contact__avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">RS</div>\n    <div class=\"rr-faq-contact__details\">\n      <strong>Raihan Shaikh</strong>\n      <span>Property Consultant · Dubai</span>\n      <small>Broker Card No. 73393</small>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"rr-faq-disclaimer\"><strong>Important information</strong><p>This page is for general information only and does not constitute legal, tax, financial, mortgage, investment or immigration advice. It is not an offer, solicitation, recommendation, valuation, or guarantee of price, return, rental income, handover date, refund or visa eligibility. Fees, thresholds and processes may change without notice. Confirm all figures, eligibility and contract terms with the Dubai Land Department, RERA, your bank or a licensed professional before making a payment or signing any document. This page is governed by the laws of the Emirate of Dubai and applicable federal laws of the UAE.</p></div>','Dubai Real Estate FAQs: Off-Plan, Costs, Visas and Buyer Protection','','publish','closed','closed','','dubai-real-estate-faqs','','','2026-11-24 05:31:00','2026-11-24 05:31:00','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?page_id=138',0,'page','',0);
INSERT INTO `SERVMASK_PREFIX_posts` VALUES (139,1,'2026-11-23 11:52:44','2026-11-23 11:52:44','','FAQs','','publish','closed','closed','','faqs','','','2026-11-23 11:52:44','2026-11-23 11:52:44','',0,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/faqs/',4,'nav_menu_item','',0);
