faq-disclaimer\"><strong>Important information</strong><p>This page is for general information only and does not constitute legal, tax, financial, mortgage, investment or immigration advice. It is not an offer, solicitation, recommendation, valuation, or guarantee of price, return, rental income, handover date, refund or visa eligibility. Fees, thresholds and processes may change without notice. Confirm all figures, eligibility and contract terms with the Dubai Land Department, RERA, your bank or a licensed professional before making a payment or signing any document. This page is governed by the laws of the Emirate of Dubai and applicable federal laws of the UAE.</p></div>','Dubai Real Estate FAQs: Off-Plan, Costs, Visas and Buyer Protection','','inherit','closed','closed','','138-revision-v1','','','2026-11-24 05:31:00','2026-11-24 05:31:00','',138,'https://bagheeraventures.com/realtorraihan/?p=146',0,'revision','',0);
